*.aab

# Locator baselines: the promoted files are committed on purpose — they describe
# what each page-object locator matched on a passing run, and reviewing them
# alongside the page objects is the point. `pending/` is not: it holds records
# written by a test that has not finished yet, which are discarded if it fails.
src/main/resources/baselines/pending/
